\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces 2D GPU baseline vs temporal across $N$, iters=96, defaults TILE=32, HALO=4. At small $N$ the baseline is launch-overhead- dominated; at $N{\geq }1024$ the steady-state speedup is a more honest \textbf  {1.5--3$\times $}. At $N{=}4098$ both kernels degrade (working set $128$\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}MB exceeds L40S's $\sim $96\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}MB L2). Best 2D GPU CPE = \textbf  {0.0089} at $N{=}3074$.\relax }}{11}{figure.caption.28}}
\newlabel{fig:gpu-n}{{11}{11}{2D GPU baseline vs temporal across $N$, iters=96, defaults TILE=32, HALO=4. At small $N$ the baseline is launch-overhead- dominated; at $N{\geq }1024$ the steady-state speedup is a more honest \textbf {1.5--3$\times $}. At $N{=}4098$ both kernels degrade (working set $128$\,MB exceeds L40S's $\sim $96\,MB L2). Best 2D GPU CPE = \textbf {0.0089} at $N{=}3074$.\relax }{figure.caption.28}{}}
